{"id":"95924098a9c5f575","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-relative-interpretation.md","title":"Nonempty Domain and Functional Graphs","display":"df-relative-interpretation — Nonempty Domain and Functional Graphs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-relative-interpretation","aliases":["67-df-relative-interpretation"],"display":"df-relative-interpretation — Nonempty Domain and Functional Graphs","depends_on":["[[67-df-translation]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，定义 (*)、(**)，印刷页 75；PDF 第 86 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-relative-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-relative-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relative-interpretation — Nonempty Domain and Functional Graphs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，定义 (*)、(**)，印刷页 75；PDF 第 86 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是算术公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\theta\">\\(T\\vdash\\theta\\)</span> 表示一阶逻辑中从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 推导句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_A\">\\(\\mathcal P_A\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)\">\\(D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" href=\"?note=ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd\" title=\"67-df-translation\">67-df-translation</a>。下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,u\">\\(x,y,z,u\\)</span> 为绑定对象变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\)</span> 是下式定义的相对解释合法性谓词；它尚未指定被解释的非逻辑公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\ \\bigl[&amp;\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\mu(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\n\\forall y(\\mu(y)\\to(\\eta_0(y)\\leftrightarrow y=x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\forall x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\to\n\\exists y(\\mu(y)\\land\\forall z(\\mu(z)\\to(\\eta_S(x,z)\\leftrightarrow z=y)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\star\\in\\{+,\\times\\}}\nT\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\\mu(y)\\to\n\\exists z(\\mu(z)\\land\\forall u(\\mu(u)\\to(\\eta_\\star(x,y,u)\\leftrightarrow u=z)))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\ \\bigl[&amp;\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\mu(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\n\\forall y(\\mu(y)\\to(\\eta_0(y)\\leftrightarrow y=x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\forall x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\to\n\\exists y(\\mu(y)\\land\\forall z(\\mu(z)\\to(\\eta_S(x,z)\\leftrightarrow z=y)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigwedge_{\\star\\in\\{+,\\times\\}}\nT\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\\mu(y)\\to\n\\exists z(\\mu(z)\\land\\forall u(\\mu(u)\\to(\\eta_\\star(x,y,u)\\leftrightarrow u=z)))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这四组条件分别要求域非空、零元唯一、后继为域上的全函数、加法与乘法为域上的全函数。等号保持为实际等号，因而没有另加等价关系商。</p>\n<p>来源第 75 页把这些条件与所有逻辑有效句子的翻译在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证等价起来。这里保留显式函数图条件，避免只给一个保联结词的任意公式映射就称它为解释。第 86 页图像已核对。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，定义 (*)、(**)，印刷页 75；PDF 第 86 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是算术公理集，$T\\vdash\\theta$ 表示一阶逻辑中从 $T$ 推导句子 $\\theta$（[[67-df-prim-provability]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-translation","status":"resolved","id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)$、$\\mathcal P_A$ 及 $D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)$ 取 [[67-df-translation]]。下式中的 $x,y,z,u$ 为绑定对象变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_A","display":false},{"tex":"D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\ \\bigl[&\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\\\\n&\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\mu(x)\\\\\n&\\land T\\vdash\\exists x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\n\\forall y(\\mu(y)\\to(\\eta_0(y)\\leftrightarrow y=x))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land T\\vdash\\forall x\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\to\n\\exists y(\\mu(y)\\land\\forall z(\\mu(z)\\to(\\eta_S(x,z)\\leftrightarrow z=y)))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\bigwedge_{\\star\\in\\{+,\\times\\}}\nT\\vdash\\forall x\\forall y\\bigl(\\mu(x)\\land\\mu(y)\\to\n\\exists z(\\mu(z)\\land\\forall u(\\mu(u)\\to(\\eta_\\star(x,y,u)\\leftrightarrow u=z)))\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2294,"backlinks":[{"id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelInt}(T,\\tau)$ 取 [[67-df-relative-interpretation]]；$\\tau$ 遍历算术公式函数。"},{"id":"140f19e2806d749f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"翻译使用 [[67-df-translation]] 的固定规范化和无捕获代入，合法域及函数图条件取 [[67-df-relative-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-relative-interpretation]]；[[../67-df-faithful-interpretability]]；[[../67-lem-orey-hajek]]；[[../67-thm-orey-compactness]]；[[../67-thm-interpretability-pi1]]；[[../67-df-formula-provability]]；[[../67-thm-arithmetized-completeness]]；[[../67-cor-interpretability-consistent-numeration]]；[[../67-thm-faithful-interpretability-criterion]]"}],"outgoing":["ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}